{
 "p085": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start_s": 8.3,
   "end_s": 12.34,
   "dur_s": 4.04,
   "text": "Harry doesn't want to be a star chef when he's 20.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start_s": 12.86,
   "end_s": 15.1,
   "dur_s": 2.24,
   "text": "He wants to be one now.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start_s": 15.88,
   "end_s": 20.6,
   "dur_s": 4.72,
   "text": "This is why he's on the TV programme Kitchen Kids.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start_s": 21.56,
   "end_s": 24.86,
   "dur_s": 3.3,
   "text": "The ten-year-old New Yorker likes cooking.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start_s": 25.72,
   "end_s": 32.96,
   "dur_s": 7.24,
   "text": "He can make fantastic soups and salads, excellent omelettes and the best cakes.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start_s": 33.96,
   "end_s": 36.94,
   "dur_s": 2.98,
   "text": "But there are many other children on the show, too.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start_s": 36.94,
   "end_s": 39.59,
   "dur_s": 2.65,
   "text": "And they are all very good.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start_s": 40.64,
   "end_s": 44.858,
   "dur_s": 4.218,
   "text": "More and more young people are interested in cooking.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start_s": 45.08,
   "end_s": 48.14,
   "dur_s": 3.06,
   "text": "Many of them learn it from their parents.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start_s": 49.18,
   "end_s": 53.96,
   "dur_s": 4.78,
   "text": "Others watch special cooking videos for children on YouTube.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start_s": 54.86,
   "end_s": 59.78,
   "dur_s": 4.92,
   "text": "In many cities, there are special cooking classes for young people.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start_s": 60.96,
   "end_s": 64.84,
   "dur_s": 3.88,
   "text": "Some of them are for children from the age of three!",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start_s": 66.4,
   "end_s": 69.82,
   "dur_s": 3.42,
   "text": "But what must you do to become a star chef?",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start_s": 71.08,
   "end_s": 76.208,
   "dur_s": 5.128,
   "text": "Of course, it's important that you like cooking and are really good at it.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start_s": 77.04,
   "end_s": 78.76,
   "dur_s": 1.72,
   "text": "But there are some rules.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start_s": 79.8,
   "end_s": 84.14,
   "dur_s": 4.34,
   "text": "You must be nine years old or more to be on Kitchen Kids.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start_s": 85.0,
   "end_s": 89.56,
   "dur_s": 4.56,
   "text": "'We must wash our hands before we start cooking,' Harry says.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start_s": 90.38,
   "end_s": 93.42,
   "dur_s": 3.04,
   "text": "'And of course we mustn't put them in our mouths.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start_s": 94.42,
   "end_s": 95.991,
   "dur_s": 1.571,
   "text": "A chef doesn't do that!",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start_s": 95.88,
   "end_s": 99.64,
   "dur_s": 3.76,
   "text": "And we must be very careful with hot plates.'",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start_s": 100.9,
   "end_s": 101.84,
   "dur_s": 0.94,
   "text": "The show starts.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start_s": 102.96,
   "end_s": 104.26,
   "dur_s": 1.3,
   "text": "Harry is excited.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start_s": 105.34,
   "end_s": 107.48,
   "dur_s": 2.14,
   "text": "He knows he's an excellent cook.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start_s": 108.72,
   "end_s": 115.972,
   "dur_s": 7.252,
   "text": "This time he makes tomato soup, some salad, steak and carrot cake.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start_s": 116.92,
   "end_s": 122.683,
   "dur_s": 5.763,
   "text": "The experts in the studio love Harry's food, and he stays on the show.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start_s": 123.84,
   "end_s": 125.12,
   "dur_s": 1.28,
   "text": "It's 5 pm.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start_s": 125.98,
   "end_s": 127.141,
   "dur_s": 1.161,
   "text": "The show is over.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start_s": 127.9,
   "end_s": 130.6,
   "dur_s": 2.7,
   "text": "Harry is happy, and a little tired.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start_s": 131.68,
   "end_s": 132.563,
   "dur_s": 0.883,
   "text": "He goes home.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start_s": 133.3,
   "end_s": 134.92,
   "dur_s": 1.62,
   "text": "It's time to do his homework.",
   "confidence": 1.0
  }
 ],
 "p087": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start_s": 10.82,
   "end_s": 12.84,
   "dur_s": 2.02,
   "text": "Can we make some sandwiches, Dad?",
   "confidence": 1.0
  },
